<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    SalamTV subscriber sign-in. App-module strings on purpose: this screen exists only in the
    operator build, and core stays the generic player.

    Business wording (expired / suspended / wrong password) is NOT here — it comes from the panel
    so the operator can change it without shipping an app. Only what the panel can never answer
    lives in this file.
-->
<resources>
